  skillName: Thermal Throttling
  description: Send a large number of high-energy-consuming garbage operation instructions
    to the target, causing its system to overheat. Make the target fall into the
    "burned" state (level 5). In this state, the AlgoMon will lose a fixed amount
    of health points each round. Counter win:The opponent gains an additional 3 layers
    of burning effect
